# Mycosynth Lattice sacrificed to Krark-Clan Ironworks in the mana window of a special action (turning Ainok Tracker
# face up for {4}{R}) is gone when the cost is paid (CR 601.2g-h, 116.2b), so colorless mana can't pay the {R} (CR 609.4b
# no longer applies, CR 611.3a) and the action is taken back (CR 733.1): Ainok stays face down. The permission is read as
# the mana is spent, after the window (`actions::spend_any_now`), not before it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Ainok Tracker
Mycosynth Lattice
Krark-Clan Ironworks
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Ainok Tracker.Cast(Ability: Morph)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Mycosynth Lattice.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Krark-Clan Ironworks.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Types = Land; Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.#1.Activate(Ability: morph cost)
Bot1.Battlefield.Krark-Clan Ironworks.Activate(Sacrifice: Island)
Bot1.Battlefield.Krark-Clan Ironworks.Activate(Sacrifice: Mycosynth Lattice)
Bot1.Battlefield.Krark-Clan Ironworks.Activate(Sacrifice: Krark-Clan Ironworks)
# The {C} pays the {4}, and the {R} is still owed with nothing that may pay it: the action can't be completed (CR 733.1).
Bot1.Cancel
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield..Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Ainok Tracker
